  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-07-20T15:55:35-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, July 20, 2017, 3:55 pm\">July 20, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<figure id=\"attachment_3216\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img class=\"wp-image-3216 size-large\" src=\"/media/archive/b4f76120471fe083396bc4fe7d32e1e41ac97f0440642b31dfe98ff8e4b09b78.jpg\" alt=\"©Martha Little Fuentes, The Practice Session. Oil on canvas, 11 x 14 inches\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3216\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">©Martha Little Fuentes, The Practice Session. Oil on canvas, 11 x 14 inches.</figcaption></figure>\n<h3>Meet The Artists, Martha Little Fuentes and Erica Dale Strzepek, Saturday, July 29 from 2 – 4 pm at The Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists</h3>\n<p>Little Fuentes will demonstrate the use of quick value studies (thumbnails) and underpainting to gain depth in oil painting.</p>\n<p>Strzepek, a watercolor painter, will discuss her transition from painting traditional watercolor on paper to painting on board. She will demonstrate techniques, materials, and finishing.</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2155\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-2155\" src=\"/media/archive/ed394b34dd8fb440a8a347736078c204fb40f98b61d0b57e8a1c3dbd69e67de0.jpg\" alt=\"©Erica Dale Strzepek, Sunset on Earle Road Beach. Watercolor, 8 x 8 inches.\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2155\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">©Erica Dale Strzepek, Sunset on Earle Road Beach. Watercolor, 8 x 8 inches.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists, 551 Main Street (Route 28), Harwich Port, is open 7-days a week, including extended hours for Summer Port Nights. The Art Gallery exhibits original artwork by 24 local artists. Free public parking located across the street at the Tourist Information Center of the Harwich Chamber of Commerce. Refreshments will be served.</p>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-24848e4ea0af8641d360/\" rel=\"tag\">EDUCATION</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-a2dd2a8b0cc8efdccc38/\" rel=\"tag\">MEET THE ARTIST</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-3b7a7197884c65093e45/\" rel=\"tag\">THE ART GALLERY</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t<br /><span class=\"entry-terms post_tag\">Tagged <a href=\"/archive/source-b15294aebd2d97a9b8eb/\" rel=\"tag\">Erica Dale Strzepek</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-c5a0664c0f5b2d29d271/\" rel=\"tag\">Guild of Harwich Artists</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-55e09a88f1feffe4fd22/\" rel=\"tag\">Martha Little Fuentes</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-f18b6b2015591a4dcc51/\" rel=\"tag\">Meet The Artist</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-b9ab081a4bc798f19819/\" rel=\"tag\">The Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists</a></span>\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
